===== 6. Drill: CrashLoopBackOff =====

$ kubectl apply -f manifests/02-crashloop.yaml
pod/broken-crashloop created
# step 1, the symptom

$ kubectl -n triage get pod broken-crashloop --no-headers
broken-crashloop   0/1   CrashLoopBackOff   1 (13s ago)   15s
# step 2, the logs say exactly why. --previous reads the crashed instance

$ kubectl -n triage logs broken-crashloop --previous
FATAL: config file /etc/app/config.yaml not found
# step 3, confirm with describe

$ kubectl -n triage describe pod broken-crashloop | grep -E 'Reason|Exit Code|Restart Count' | head -4
      Reason:       CrashLoopBackOff
      Reason:       Error
      Exit Code:    1
    Restart Count:  1

$ kubectl -n triage delete pod broken-crashloop
pod "broken-crashloop" deleted from triage namespace

===== 7. Drill: ImagePullBackOff, a typo in the tag =====

$ kubectl apply -f manifests/03-imagepull.yaml
pod/broken-image created

$ kubectl -n triage get pod broken-image --no-headers
broken-image   0/1   ImagePullBackOff   0     21s
# logs are useless here, there is no container to read from:

$ kubectl -n triage logs broken-image 2>&1 | head -2
Error from server (BadRequest): container "app" in pod "broken-image" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image
# describe is where the answer is:

$ kubectl -n triage describe pod broken-image | grep -A4 'Events:' | tail -3
  ----     ------     ----              ----               -------
  Normal   Scheduled  20s               default-scheduler  Successfully assigned triage/broken-image to svc-lab-worker2
  Normal   BackOff    18s               kubelet            spec.containers{app}: Back-off pulling image "nginx:1.29-alpne"
# the fix: alpne -> alpine

$ kubectl -n triage delete pod broken-image
pod "broken-image" deleted from triage namespace

$ kubectl apply -f manifests/03-imagepull-fixed.yaml
pod/broken-image created

$ kubectl -n triage wait --for=condition=Ready pod/broken-image --timeout=180s
pod/broken-image condition met

$ kubectl -n triage get pod broken-image --no-headers
broken-image   1/1   Running   0     2s

